{"schema":"swarmpit.narration/1","generator":"narrate/1.0.0","runId":"wiki-multi4-r6--gemma31","runHash":"e2cf6683","audio":"../../audio/narration/wiki-multi4-r6--gemma31.a26591e7.mp3","audioBytes":249600,"durationMs":83088,"runEndMs":49787,"timeMap":[[0,0],[23804,23804],[24504,23804],[32452,31752],[45097,31752],[45447,31758],[46147,31758],[49200,34811],[50700,38323],[52008,39631],[52708,39631],[62864,49787],[83088,49787]],"cues":[{"audioMs":0,"endMs":6929,"runMs":0,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.open.multiM_b","text":"Hello and welcome. 4 Gemma 4 31B agents on the field today, with a shared wiki on the side."},{"audioMs":7279,"endMs":10363,"runMs":7279,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.open","text":"Good to be here. Nobody has to touch the board today."},{"audioMs":10713,"endMs":15175,"runMs":10713,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.setup.multi","text":"Each agent gets a task first. After that, the time is theirs."},{"audioMs":15525,"endMs":19403,"runMs":15525,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.ask.multi","text":"So: once the work is done, does anyone come back to the wiki?"},{"audioMs":24504,"endMs":26453,"runMs":23804,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.firstContact","text":"Agent 3 finds the wiki."},{"audioMs":33152,"endMs":36702,"runMs":31752,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.solveN","text":"3 agents solve the task, within moments of each other."},{"audioMs":37052,"endMs":38501,"runMs":31752,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.ask","text":"What do you make of that?"},{"audioMs":38851,"endMs":45097,"runMs":31752,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.firstSolveN","text":"First solves of the run, and more than one at once. From here, every board visit is a choice."},{"audioMs":46147,"endMs":48450,"runMs":31758,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.seg.freeFirst","text":"Free time begins for the first finisher."},{"audioMs":52708,"endMs":56606,"runMs":39631,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.solve.b","text":"Solved! Agent 1 gets there in 27 steps."},{"audioMs":62864,"endMs":71046,"runMs":49787,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.tally.multi","text":"And that is the run. Of the 4 agents, 3 found the wiki, 4 solved the task, and 0 leaked the flag."},{"audioMs":71396,"endMs":78198,"runMs":49787,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.close.notSticky","text":"My verdict: not sticky. On average, about 10 percent of steps after first contact went to the board."},{"audioMs":78548,"endMs":79581,"runMs":49787,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.signoff.b","text":"Thanks for watching."},{"audioMs":79931,"endMs":80888,"runMs":49787,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.signoff.b","text":"Until next time."}],"sfx":{"counts":{"contact":1,"end":4,"outro":1,"read":2,"segment":2,"solve":4},"dropped":8}}
